OL,3,CTrain services to be diverted due to
OL,4,Chot weather
OL,6,FSouth Western Railway has confirmed
OL,7,Fsome of its services will need to be
OL,8,Fdiverted because of the ongoing hot
OL,9,Fweather.
OL,11,FThe train operator said that high
OL,12,Ftemperatures forecast on Monday and
OL,13,FTuesday mean services from Portsmouth
OL,14,FHarbour to London Waterloo, will run
OL,15,Fvia an alternative route through
OL,16,FCobham after departure from Guildford.
OL,18,FThe changes will be from 10am to 5pm
OL,19,Fon both days, with the operator saying
OL,20,Fit will "help us provide a more
OL,21,Freliable and resilient service".
