OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FSWR said online journey planners will
OL,12,Fbe updated 24 hours beforehand and
OL,13,Fpassengers have been advised to check
OL,14,Fbefore they travel.
OL,16,FThe alterations follow the company's
OL,17,Fdecision to halve the number of trains
OL,18,Fbetween Yeovil Junction and Exeter St
OL,19,FDavids, as part of alterations on the
OL,20,FWest of England line to London
OL,21,FWaterloo.
